1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,000
Ste opazili, da se iz zunanje enote pozimi kadi?

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,400
Brez skrbi – to ni dim, ampak vodna para.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,300
V mrazu se na lamelah zunanje enote nabira ivje.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,900
Črpalka ga za nekaj minut stopi.

5
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,800
Para, kapljanje in mirujoč ventilator so pri tem normalni.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,300
Če led ostane, naj enoto pregleda serviser.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,900
Redni servis poskrbi, da odtaljevanje deluje pravilno.
